what perfect timing.

288
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:52,238
The TV and VCR we sent out for repair,

289
00:16:52,288 --> 00:16:54,940
they were almost not
coming back until tomorrow.

290
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:59,220
It's the world's first VCR with voice reservation,
you know.

291
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:03,060
Even a machine-illiterate chief
like you can operate this easily.

292
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:06,980
