326
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:51,740
You scared me!

327
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:54,080
Your face is bad for the heart, Chief.

328
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:56,060
What's he doing?

329
00:18:59,460 --> 00:19:02,220
What, he's already
getting ready to watch it?

330
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:03,960
Without even knowing
what's going to happen...

331
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:07,640
Is that all it is?

332
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:10,540
Guess I'll try them all out.

333
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:15,920
And then the bow.

334
00:19:16,820 --> 00:19:18,020
