335
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:19,480
Alright, good.

336
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,320
Stop.

337
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:23,160
Your bow lacks sincerity.

338
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:27,660
You're not mocking me,
looking down on me like that, are you?

339
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,820
N-no, never, nothing like that.

340
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:32,680
Then show me some sincerity.

341
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:35,060
Ha-ha-ha, ha-a-a.

342
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,080
Very well.

343
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,320
