a program reservation?

345
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:44,100
Y-yes, please. The Flower of the Bakumatsu.

346
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,200
Then, please take off your clothes.

347
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:48,160
My clothes?

348
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:49,780
And then dance.

349
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:52,960
Otherwise, I can't make the reservation.

350
00:19:57,900 --> 00:19:58,460
Hare...

351
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,680
Yes, I took them off and danced.

352
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,660
Don't lie.

353
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:02,660
W-why?

354
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:04,660
I can tell from the
vibrations of your dancing.

355
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:07,780
If you're not willing,
I can't record anything.

356
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:11,340
Understood, I'll do it!

357
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,960
Aa, kōrya kōrya

358
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:20,760
Aa, kōrya kōrya

359
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,400
I'm dying, I'm dying

360
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:28,280
